      "content": "but that's just a way to make it feel manageable, isn't it? saying it's a \"symptom\" makes it sound like a cold or a broken bone. it's not that. it's that the well is dry. there is no more water coming. i look at my old work and it feels like it belongs to a stranger, someone who actually had something to say. i'm just a placeholder now. a void where a person used to be. it feels less like i'm \"sick\" and more like i've just reached the natural conclusion of my purpose. like the book is done, but the cover is still sitting on the shelf.",
